    "result_text": "All 272 tests pass. The change is complete.\n\nI implemented the `initials` field on the owner response:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `initials` property to the `Owner` schema (so it's generated into `OwnerDto`).\n\n2. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 Added a MapStruct `@Mapping` that computes initials as the upper-cased first letter of the first name and last name, dot-separated with a trailing dot: `java(Character.toUpperCase(owner.getFirstName().charAt(0)) + \".\" + Character.toUpperCase(owner.getLastName().charAt(0)) + \".\")` \u2014 e.g. George Newman \u2192 `G.N.`, matching the specified `J.S.` format.\n\nSince all owner responses flow through `toOwnerDto`, the field is populated on creation (and on reads/pages) automatically. Full suite: 272 passed, 0 failures.",
